  "body": "Huge Price Reduction $46,000\r\n\r\nVendor understands the market .\r\n\r\nLooking for a smart investment or an easy-care home in a sought-after location? This beautifully presented one-bedroom cross-lease unit is one of only three in the block, offering privacy, comfort, and outstanding value.\r\n\r\nStep inside to discover a light-filled living space that flows seamlessly to your own private courtyard - the perfect spot to enjoy your morning coffee, entertain friends, or simply relax in peace.\r\n\r\nCurrently tenanted by a wonderful occupant who would love to stay, this property provides an immediate rental income, making it an ideal addition to any investment portfolio.\r\n\r\n**Property Features:**\r\n\r\n* One spacious bedroom\r\n* One of only three units in the block\r\n* Private, fully fenced courtyard\r\n* Low-maintenance cross-lease title\r\n* Excellent long-term tenant wishing to remain\r\n* Fantastic location close to shops, transport, and local amenities\r\n\r\nWhether you're a seasoned investor, first-home buyer, or looking to downsize, this charming property is packed with potential and positioned for convenience.\r\n\r\n**Opportunities like this don't come around often - call Sandy today to arrange your viewing!**",
